<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Greyhound started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Greyhound started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Greyhound Lines Inc as attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Kim Howard was not available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- Greyhound closed Monday at four.</p>
